@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Pending : customer places order
Pending --> Preparing : timer 10s / manager starts
Preparing --> Ready : timer 20s / manager marks ready
Ready --> Served : timer 30s / manager marks served
Pending --> Cancelled : manager cancels
Preparing --> Cancelled : manager cancels
Ready --> Cancelled : manager cancels
Served --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
